                <pb facs="0485" n="381" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg381"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 837.77/69.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Habana</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-05-14">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 14, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>If the Department wishes to object to the Nuevitas-Caibarién railway matter the
                    Legation should be instructed at once as the project is now under discussion in
                    Congress.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Beaupré</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
